cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "hs-crosswalk-us-mx: the US Harmonized Tariff Schedule joined with Mexico's TIGIE at HS-6"
abstract: >-
  The current Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (HTSUS) as clean open
  files with its indent hierarchy, rates as published and footnotes, joined with
  Mexico's tariff (TIGIE fracciones and NICOs) at the shared 6-digit Harmonized
  System subheading. A match means the same international subheading, not
  equivalent national lines or duties.
authors:
  - name: "Baja Labs"
version: "1.0.0"
license:
