  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bajalabs/hs-crosswalk-us-mx"
keywords:
  - HTSUS
  - TIGIE
  - NICO
  - Harmonized System
  - tariff
  - customs
  - United States
  - Mexico
  - crosswalk
references:
